# netpbm doing real image work, rendered back to characters so a screen can
# hold it.  204 of the 834 programs here are this toolkit and until now one
# pipeline had ever been photographed.
shot    pbmtext
cap     pbmtext sets a line of type as a bitmap; pbmtoascii renders that
cap     bitmap back as characters.  Nothing is drawn by hand.
run     /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pbmtext "OS-9/68K" | /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pbmtoascii
wait    6

shot    pbmupc
cap     pbmupc draws a real UPC-A barcode from its digits.  Rendered here
cap     through pbmtoascii, the bar widths are the code.
run     /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pbmupc 0 72890 00011 | /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pbmreduce 3 | /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pbmtoascii
wait    8

shot    ppmpat
cap     ppmpat generates a tartan; ppmtopgm and pgmtopbm dither it down to
cap     black and white, and pbmtoascii prints the result.
run     /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/ppmpat -tartan 76 44 | /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/ppmtopgm | /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pgmtopbm | /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pbmtoascii
wait    10

shot    pgmcrater
cap     pgmcrater makes a cratered fractal landscape by dropping craters at
cap     random -- a whole moon from a random number generator.
run     /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pgmcrater -number 60 -width 152 -height 88 | /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pgmtopbm | /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pbmtoascii
wait    20

shot    pgmramp
cap     A greyscale ramp dithered to a bitmap: the gradient survives as the
cap     density of the characters.
run     /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pgmramp -lr 152 44 | /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pgmtopbm | /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pbmtoascii
wait    8

shot    pgmhist
cap     pgmhist counts how many pixels hold each grey value -- the histogram
cap     of the ramp above, which is flat by construction.
run     /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pgmramp -lr 64 16 > /dd/tmp/ramp.pgm
wait    3
run     /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pgmhist /dd/tmp/ramp.pgm | /dd/CMDS/head -n 16
wait    5

shot    pnmfile
cap     pnmfile identifies what each intermediate in a pipeline actually is
cap     -- format, dimensions and whether it is raw or plain.
run     /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pgmtopbm /dd/tmp/ramp.pgm > /dd/tmp/ramp.pbm
wait    3
run     /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/ppmpat -gingham2 40 20 > /dd/tmp/ging.ppm
wait    3
run     /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pnmfile /dd/tmp/ramp.pgm /dd/tmp/ramp.pbm /dd/tmp/ging.ppm
wait    4

shot    pbmlife
cap     pbmlife runs Conway's Life one generation on a bitmap -- an image
cap     tool that is also a cellular automaton.
run     /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pgmnoise 60 30 | /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pgmtopbm | /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pbmlife | /dd/CMDS/NETPBM/pbmtoascii
wait    10
